# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for Clothbound on uninstrumented system Qt6.
#
# System libQt6Core.so.6 is compiled without -fsanitize=thread, so TSan cannot
# observe the internal queue mutex release/acquire edge inside QThreadPool::start()
# when a pooled thread is reused. This causes false positives when a worker thread
# reads constructor-initialized members or lambda captures of a freshly enqueued
# QRunnable.
#
# Keep every rule tightly scoped to QThreadPool runnable handoffs; never suppress
# libQt6Core.so globally or Clothbound's own threading/synchronization subsystems.
race:qrunnable.h
race:QRunnable::QGenericRunnable
race_top:CoverResponse::run
race_top:BookImageResponse::run
race_top:PageResponse::run
race_top:PrefetchTask::run
